# libssl3 3.0.18-1~deb12u2 in gcr.io/distroless/nodejs24-debian12:nonroot
# Added 2026-09-18. Fixes exist upstream (3.0.19 / 3.0.20) but distroless has not
# rebuilt, so these cannot be resolved by re-pinning the digest - the pinned
# digest is already the current :nonroot build.
#
# Not reachable by this application: Node bundles its own OpenSSL (3.5.5), and
# nothing in the image links the Debian libssl3 - verified by scanning every .so,
# .node and the node binary for a libssl.so.3 reference, which matched only
# libssl.so.3 itself. All outbound TLS (Mailgun, OpenAI) uses Node's OpenSSL.
#
# Re-check: whenever the distroless digest is refreshed. Drop these lines once
# the base ships >= 3.0.20 and confirm the scan still passes.
